<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="so">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Raalli-gelin Saaxiibtey ❤️</title>

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1b1020, #4a1f35);
    color: white;
}

.card {
    width: 90%;
    max-width: 440px;
    padding: 35px 25px;
    text-align: center;
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
}

.heart {
    font-size: 45px;
}

h1 {
    color: #ffb6c9;
    font-size: 28px;
    margin: 15px 0;
}

p {
    color: #f5f5f5;
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: 16px;
}

button {
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding: 14px 30px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 30px;
    background: #ff5c8a;
    color: white;
    font-size: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
}

button:active {
    transform: scale(0.96);
}

#message {
    display: none;
    margin-top: 25px;
    color: #ffcfda;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="card">

    <div class="heart">🥺❤️</div>

    <h1>Saaxiibtey, Iga Raalli Noqo</h1>

    <p>
        Saaxiib, maanta waxaan ogahay inaan
        <strong>parankiga</strong> kugu sameeyay 😂😭
    </p>

    <p>
        Waan kaftamay, laakiin haddii uu kaa xumaaday
        ama aan dareenkaaga dhaawacay,
        runtii <strong>waan ka xumahay.</strong> ❤️
    </p>

    <p>
        Ma rabin inaan ku xanaajiyo ama ku xumeeyo.
        Wax walba waxay ahaayeen kaftan,
        laakiin saaxiibtinimadeenna ayaa iga muhiimsan. 🫶
    </p>

    <button onclick="forgiveMe()">
        Iga Raalli Noqo? 🥺
    </button>

    <div id="message">
        Mahadsanid saaxiibtey ❤️<br>
        Mar dambe sidaas kuguma samayn doono... 
        ama ugu yaraan waan isku dayayaa 😂😭
    </div>

</div>

<script>
function forgiveMe() {
    document.getElementById("message").style.display = "block";
}
</script>

</body>
</html>